{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016080056794-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016080825\"/><p>事主送往威爾斯親王醫院搶救不治。</p><p>馬鞍山有人墮樓亡。今日(16日)凌晨4時30分，有途人報案，指發現一名女子倒臥在鞍駿街15號對開，懷疑她從高處墮下。人員接報到場，將昏迷事主送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，其後被證實死亡。人員於現場沒有檢獲遺書，經初步調查相信，姓朱(80歲)老婦從上址一平台墮下，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:53.665467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:59:04.155367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:42.315665+00:00","content_hash":"f7162f74760076307f8d01c21e7e7ff67de045f75eebac470efe9132de94e01c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}